      "content": "yeah i get the trade-offs, but the savings are pretty massive. the static system doesn't require the same real-time processing loops, so we'd basically just be cutting out the active optimization layer entirely. i haven't run the full numbers on the intake loss yet, but surely it's not that big of a deal if we just stay within the baseline targets?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
